<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech bank CZK 2.7 bln 96 net profit-IAS.</title>
<headline>Czech bank CZK 2.7 bln 96 net profit-IAS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceska Sporitelna a.s., the largest Czech savings bank, said on Wednesday it posted a 2.739 billion crown ($90.2 million) consolidated net profit for 1996, calculated according to international accounting standards (IAS).</p>
<p>In 1995, Sporitelna posted a 1.442 billion crown IAS consolidated net profit. ($ = 30.35 Czech Crowns)</p>
</text>
